	(descr "XFCN T34069 / LCSC C481452 threaded side-face PCB soldering terminal, M3, 40 A manufacturer rating, four THT legs. The supplied screw and washer clamp an external conductor against the threaded terminal face; all four solder legs are one electrical node. Main-PCB hole pattern is pinned from the LCSC/EasyEDA package and must be sample-verified before release because the manufacturer drawing does not dimension that land pattern.")
